Ported code
-----------

No third-party code has been ported into this repository yet. The CPU encoder
and transcoders will be a port of parts of Basis Universal (Binomial LLC,
Apache-2.0); each ported item will carry an attribution at its head, and this
file will name the upstream version and commit when the first one lands.
